  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Season the duck legs with salt and pepper.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lemon juice and olive oil.",
    "Add the sliced olives, artichoke hearts, sun-dried tomatoes, and chopped parsley to the bowl, and toss to combine.",
    "In a separate saucepan, cook the sushi rice according to package instructions.",
    "Once the rice is cooked, let it cool to room temperature.",
    "Shape the cooled rice into nigiri shapes.",
    "Place a piece of cooked sushi rice on each nigiri shape.",
    "Top each nigiri with a piece of roasted duck leg.",
    "Drizzle the lemon-olive oil mixture over the top of each nigiri.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
